    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "context": "Observing the heavy silence at the table, the priestess decides to lighten the mood by mentioning the high elf archer's peculiar taste in tavern snacks.",
        "kind": "social_initiation",
        "topic": "shared_meal_habits"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 40,
      "issued_at_tick": 34,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "priestess",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "kind": "social_interaction",
        "target": "player",
        "text": "既然难得来到这里，我们要不要也检查一下大家的装备？毕竟接下来的委托可能会很辛苦呢。",
        "topic": "equipment_maintenance"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 59,
      "issued_at_tick": 35,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "priestess",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "content": "（她结束了祈祷，站起身，忧心忡忡地看着你）既然已经确认了那些痕迹，我们是不是该回公会告诉哥布林杀手先生？这种不详的预感...地母神在上，希望只是我的错觉。",
        "kind": "talk",
        "target_id": "player"
      },
      "expires_at_tick": 60,
      "issued_at_tick": 36,
      "linked_quest_id": null,
      "npc_id": "priestess",
      "priority": "high",
      "source": "narrative_planner"
    },
    {
      "consumed": false,
      "directive": {
        "content": "喂，别在那里发呆了。既然情报都到手了，这种规模的‘大生意’，不去喝一杯庆祝一下顺便商量对策吗？我可不想在神庙里闻一整天的焚香味道。",
        "kind": "talk",
        "target_id": "player"
      },
